WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.536 --> 00:00:01.777
Good morning!

2
00:00:01.797 --> 00:00:04.019
Who are you?

3
00:00:04.039 --> 00:00:06.341
I'm a Galapagos tortoise.

4
00:00:06.541 --> 00:00:14.848
We are the biggest tortoises in the world.

5
00:00:14.868 --> 00:00:17.570
Where do you live?

6
00:00:30.460 --> 00:00:32.902
We live in the Galapagos Islands.

7
00:00:35.004 --> 00:00:37.866
These islands are in the Pacific Ocean.

8
00:00:40.308 --> 00:00:41.409
What do you eat?

9
00:00:42.930 --> 00:00:46.072
We eat grass, leaves, and cactus.

10
00:00:48.034 --> 00:00:49.255
We have no teeth.

11
00:00:52.117 --> 00:00:55.320
But we can bite food with our mouths.

12
00:01:01.088 --> 00:01:03.370
You have really thick legs!

13
00:01:05.251 --> 00:01:09.675
Yes. Our strong legs hold up our bodies.

14
00:01:14.639 --> 00:01:16.681
Our shells are very heavy!

15
00:01:19.983 --> 00:01:21.885
You're a good swimmer, right?

16
00:01:23.906 --> 00:01:24.807
Not really.

17
00:01:26.448 --> 00:01:30.652
Unlike turtles, tortoises mostly stay on land.

18
00:01:32.224 --> 00:01:34.626
We like to bask in the sun.

19
00:01:38.409 --> 00:01:39.730
Who are your enemies?

20
00:01:41.611 --> 00:01:46.094
Some humans hunt us, but most protect us.

21
00:01:48.516 --> 00:01:51.258
A few animals eat our eggs and babies.

22
00:01:53.319 --> 00:01:55.961
We can hide in our shells for protection.

23
00:01:58.123 --> 00:01:59.284
How old are you?

24
00:02:01.164 --> 00:02:03.466
I'm 95 years old.

25
00:02:05.568 --> 00:02:08.350
We live for a really long time.

26
00:02:10.692 --> 00:02:13.174
I'm going to bask in the sun now.

27
00:02:15.195 --> 00:02:20.740
Good-bye! Good-bye, Galapagos Tortoise!
